{"prototypeToken":{"displayName":20,"displayBars":20,"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":true}},"height":1,"width":1,"name":"Atoning Spirit","actorLink":false,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/tokens/atoning-spirit.webp","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"negative":false,"priority":0},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/subjects/atoning-spirit.webp"}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"depth":1},"name":"Atoning Spirit","type":"npc","effects":[],"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":71,"temp":0,"max":71,"details":"rejuvenation"},"ac":{"value":23,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":0,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"fly","value":30}],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"death-effects","exceptions":[]},{"type":"disease","exceptions":[]},{"type":"paralyzed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"poison","exceptions":[]},{"type":"precision","exceptions":[]},{"type":"unconscious","exceptions":[]}],"resistances":[{"type":"all-damage","value":5,"exceptions":["force","ghost-touch"],"doubleVs":["non-magical"]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["common","fey"],"details":"tongues"},"level":{"value":6},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Whether the agent of a deity, the embodiment of a holiday, or a fey spirit seeking to teach mortals a lesson, an atoning spirit appears to those in need, whether they want its aid or not. An atoning spirit's goal isn't to harm their target but instead to convince them to atone for their sins. They use powerful illusions and insights into the target's life to show their target visions of their lives that led to the transgressions and caught the atoning spirit's attention.</p>\n<p>An atoning spirit may appear in any form it likes, but they often choose that of someone close to the target: a deceased friend or relative, or an older or younger version of the target itself.</p>\n<p>A person can attract the attention of an atoning spirit either through the performance of an atone ritual or by encountering an atoning spirit and behaving in a way that makes the spirit believe they're seeking atonement. The atoning spirit leaves once the creature has either properly atoned for its sins or sincerely no longer wishes to atone.</p>\n<h2>False Witness</h2>\n<p>Sometimes, when friends and family have had enough of a loved one's misbehavior, they'll hire a caster or just dress themselves up to impersonate an atoning spirit in hopes of changing the reprobate's ways. This type of intervention rarely has the lasting effects of proper atonement and sometimes suffers the awkwardness of an actual atoning spirit showing up to disapprove of the falsehood.</p>\n<h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2>\n<p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 30/65/125 gp</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> perception item, skill items (Deception, Diplomacy, Intimidation, Lore [Penitent], Nature, Religion, Society)</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, dexterity, energy resistant (positive), mental, spells (Primal: atone, invisibility, teleport), wild, winged</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Strange and Unusual","authors":"Michael Vieths","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"creatureType":""},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":2},"dex":{"mod":4},"con":{"mod":1},"int":{"mod":2},"wis":{"mod":7},"cha":{"mod":2}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":18,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":11,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":14,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":17,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"deception":{"base":13},"diplomacy":{"base":15},"intimidation":{"base":15},"nature":{"base":18},"religion":{"base":18},"society":{"base":15}},"traits":{"value":["incorporeal","spirit"],"rarity":"rare","size":{"value":"med"}}},"img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/Portraits/atoning-spirit.webp","items":[{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Darkvision","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Darkvision]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"darkvision","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.12.6","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1686152770019,"modifiedTime":1686152770019,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.qCCLZhnp2HhP3Ex6","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"xjBT4YWdzohvBZeO"},{"name":"Penitent Lore","type":"lore","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"mod":{"value":18},"proficient":{"value":0}},"effects":[],"_id":"w3qy34DHozwx7aov","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/lore.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.12.6","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1686152805244,"modifiedTime":1686152815069,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Know Penitent","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The atoning spirit is able to read the penitent's mind, learning relevant bits of their past in order to ascertain how best to influence them. The penitent may attempt a @Check[type:will|dc:24] save.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e.pf2e-battlezoo-su-effects.4yGE05EbIRcxfPul]{Effect: Know Penitent (Atoning Spirit)}</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e.pf2e-battlezoo-su-effects.mxKZGAzFrszb6LEV]{Effect: Know Penitent (Penitent)}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The penitent is unaffected and is temporarily immune to Know Penitent for 1 hour.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The atoning spirit gains a +2 circumstance bonus to Diplomacy checks against the penitent, and the penitent takes a –2 circumstance penalty on Deception checks against the atoning spirit. These effects last for 1 hour.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the circumstance bonus to Diplomacy checks increases to +4, and the circumstance penalty to Deception checks increases to –4.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["linguistic","mental"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"8wM9Z6e7RDwwwAsD","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1686152866260,"modifiedTime":1689205892175,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Penitent Lore","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The atoning spirit is able to read a penitent's entire lifetime. Their Penitent Lore skill is specific to their target for the purposes of knowing details about the penitent's life and personality.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"Bz6UIvDabVg5jtQY","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.0.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1686153748574,"modifiedTime":1687551763178,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Show Vision","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The atoning spirit creates the effects of an <em>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.Ucf8eynbZMfUucjE]{Illusory Scene}</em> of the penitent's past, present, or future. The illusions created by this ability are interactive and react in a manner consistent with their appearance (food has flavor and scent, loved ones behave as the target expects, etc.). The vision must be consistent with the actions for which the penitent is atoning.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["auditory","illusion","mental","olfactory","visual"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"BCu6mm8nU0JdRuFn","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.12.6","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1686153782694,"modifiedTime":1686153831996,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Rejuvenation","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>When an atoning spirit is destroyed, it reforms, fully healed, within [[/br 2d4 #Days]]{2d4 days}, appearing in the vicinity of the penitent. If it's destroyed without a penitent, it instead appears near a potential penitent.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"ghost-rejuvenation","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["divine"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":true,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.12.6","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1686153976293,"modifiedTime":1686153997548,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-family-ability-glossary.Item.unR8VVR4yyRnsmnB","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"0gGOEWmrZ2bRpc9Y"},{"type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Hand of Atonement","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["agile","finesse","magical"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"8v3rgigYCmIdE7Zp":{"damage":"2d4+7","damageType":"mental","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":15},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"effects":[],"_id":"OPoGwMZafP2AGysW","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1686154012791,"modifiedTime":1689206021068,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"name":"Primal Innate Spells","type":"spellcastingEntry","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"ability":{"value":"cha"},"spelldc":{"value":16,"dc":24},"tradition":{"value":"primal"},"prepared":{"value":"innate"},"showSlotlessLevels":{"value":false},"proficiency":{"value":1},"slots":{"slot0":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot1":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot2":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot3":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot4":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot5":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot6":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot7":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot8":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot9":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot10":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot11":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0}},"autoHeightenLevel":{"value":null},"showUnpreparedSpells":{"value":false},"displayLevels":{}},"_id":"9iphrmlHOXTb0U8r","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/spellcastingEntry.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.12.6","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1686154078199,"modifiedTime":1686154185626,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/teleport.webp","name":"Teleport (At Will, Self And Penitent Only)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You and the targets are instantly transported to any location within range, as long as you can identify the location precisely both by its position relative to your starting position and by its appearance (or other identifying features). Incorrect knowledge of the location's appearance usually causes the spell to fail, but it could instead lead to teleporting to an unwanted location or some other unusual mishap determined by the GM. Teleport is not precise over great distances. The targets appear at a distance from the intended destination equal to roughly 1 percent of the total distance traveled, in a direction determined by the GM. For short journeys, this lack of precision is irrelevant, but for long distances this could be up to 1 mile.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> You and the other targets can travel to any location within 1,000 miles.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (8th)</strong> You and the other targets can travel to any location on the same planet. If you travel more than 1,000 miles, you arrive only 10 miles off target.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (9th)</strong> You and the other targets can travel to any location on another planet within the same solar system. Assuming you have accurate knowledge of the location's position and appearance, you arrive on the new planet 100 miles off target.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (10th)</strong> As the 9th-level version, but you and the other targets can travel to any planet within the same galaxy.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"teleport","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","teleportation"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":6},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"you and up to 4 targets touched, either willing creatures or objects roughly the size of a creature."},"range":{"value":"100 miles"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"10 minutes"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"9iphrmlHOXTb0U8r","heightenedLevel":6},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.12.6","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1686154128324,"modifiedTime":1686154140871,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.69L70wKfGDY66Mk9","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"jkiYNC6ePgQasRVa"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"At-Will Spells","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.AtWillSpells]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"at-will-spells","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.12.6","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1686154148578,"modifiedTime":1686154148578,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.2YRDYVnC1eljaXKK","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"FAkf575zjrGu362y"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/invisibility.webp","name":"Invisibility (At Will, Self And Penitent Only)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Cloaked in illusion, the target becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]. This makes it @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VRSef5y1LmL2Hkjf] to all creatures, though the creatures can attempt to find the target, making it @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.iU0fEDdBp3rXpTMC] to them instead. If the target uses a hostile action, the spell ends after that hostile action is completed.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The spell lasts 1 minute, but it doesn't end if the target uses a hostile action.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"invisibility","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["illusion","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"10 minutes","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"9iphrmlHOXTb0U8r","heightenedLevel":2},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.12.6","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1686154156303,"modifiedTime":1686154160838,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.XXqE1eY3w3z6xJCB","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"mRdqyz205fK1Vkph"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/tongues.webp","name":"Tongues (Constant)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The target can understand all words regardless of language and also speak the languages of other creatures. When in a mixed group of creatures, each time the target speaks, it can choose a creature and speak in a language that creature understands, even if the target doesn't know what language that is.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The duration is 8 hours.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"tongues","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":5},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 hour","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"9iphrmlHOXTb0U8r","heightenedLevel":5},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.12.6","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1686154170316,"modifiedTime":1686154177572,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.SwUiVavHKMWG7t5K","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"PzhFKQ89wcUhXzLx"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Constant Spells","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ConstantSpells]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"constant-spells","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.12.6","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1686154183752,"modifiedTime":1686154183752,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.kakyXBG5WA8c6Zfd","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"RsCJDQi9jrVv5ADl"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/atone.webp","name":"Atone","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You attempt to help a truly penitent creature atone for its misdeeds, typically actions contrary to your deity's alignment or anathema to your deity. If the creature isn't truly penitent, the outcome is always a critical failure. This ritual uses Nature if the target is a druid, and Religion in all other cases.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature receives absolution for its misdeeds, allowing it to regain standing with your deity. It returns to its previous alignment (if its alignment shifted) and regains any abilities it lost. Before the atonement is complete, the creature must perform a special quest or other task chosen by your deity, as befits its misdeeds. If completed during downtime, this task should take no less than 1 month. For 1 month, the target receives divine insight just before performing an act that would be anathema to your deity or contrary to your deity's alignment.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> As critical success, but the creature gains no special insight regarding its subsequent actions.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature does not receive absolution and must continue to meditate and redress its misdeeds. Any future atone rituals for the same misdeeds cost half as much and gain a +4 circumstance bonus to primary and secondary checks.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature offends your deity and is permanently cast out from the faith. The creature can't rejoin your religion without a more direct intervention.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> Increase the maximum target level by 2 and the base cost by 20 gp.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"atone","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":[]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":4},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"another creature of up to 8th level who is a worshipper of the same deity or philosophy as you"},"range":{"value":"10 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"1 day"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":"rare incense and offerings worth a total value of 20 gp × the target's level"},"location":{"value":null},"counteraction":false,"ritual":{"primary":{"check":"Nature or Religion (expert)"},"secondary":{"checks":"Nature or Religion (whichever is used for the primary check)","casters":0}}},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.12.6","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1686154190244,"modifiedTime":1686154190244,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.7Fd4lxozd11MQ55N","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"Hplm0OobVMLKFLjw"}],"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"6.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685401626117,"modifiedTime":1736542899355,"lastModifiedBy":"l2rbNx2a8f5ocpeL","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"wswVqWqffTELSsGx","folder":"rnSyamM9GQTIpuOo","ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"sort":10200000}